@startuml
' TraceabilityGraph — lifecycle states
' Shows the phases from creation through querying

skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam stateBorderColor #888888

[*] --> Empty

state Empty {
  [*] --> Ready : constructor()
}

state "Populated\n(items registered)" as Populated {
  [*] --> HasItems : addItem() × N
}

state "Complete\n(relationships added)" as Complete {
  [*] --> ReadyToQuery : addRelationship() × N
  --
  state "Validation" as Validate #FFF3E0 {
    ReadyToQuery --> Validated : validate()
    Validated --> ReadyToQuery : items/rels changed
  }
}

state "Cleared" as Cleared #FCE4EC

Empty --> Populated : addItem()
Populated --> Populated : addItem()
Populated --> Complete : addRelationship()
Complete --> Complete : addItem()\naddRelationship()
Complete --> Cleared : clear()
Cleared --> Empty

note right of Complete
  Pass 3 (link substitution)
  requires Complete state —
  all sourceFiles must be known
  to resolve cross-file xrefs.
end note

note right of Validate
  validate() checks:
  • Orphaned relationships
  • Circular references (DFS)
  • Role/relation rule violations
  Returns ValidationResult with
  errors[] and warnings[].
end note

@enduml
